      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A strong approach is to proactively address the \"character\" and traffic concerns with specific, actionable mitigation strategies. You can emphasize that the proposal includes strict design standards to maintain the neighborhood's feel, perhaps through mandated ground-level uses or specific facade requirements. For traffic, advocate for integrated, high-quality public and alternative transit options that are part of the development plan to promote responsible growth.",
